{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46120","headline":"寿春节进大蜀皇帝五首 三 · 贯休","name":"寿春节进大蜀皇帝五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茂祉遐宣胜事幷，薰风微入舜弦清。\n四洲不必归王化，一统那能计圣情。\n合合鼓钟膏雨滴，峨峨宫阙瑞烟横。\n西逾昆岳东连海，谁不梯山贺圣明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}